<s1>
<ptxt>
Install countershaft left bearing shim first and countershaft left bearing outer race in transaxle left case, and then press-fit the bearing race using special tool.
</ptxt>
<servicetool>
<servicetoolitem id = "L5B025">
<s-part>
(A)
</s-part>
<s-number num = "09913-85210">
09913–85210
</s-number>
